<section class="card card-pad space-y-4">
  <h2 class="font-display text-xl">Payment reconciliation</h2>
  <p class="text-sm text-mocha">Payment observations do not create retail sales or change inventory. C-Trax remains the retail inventory reference. Refunds retain their original transaction link; voids retain their source status. Tips and customer surcharges are shown only when returned. Processing fees are unavailable. Currency stays unknown when the gateway enables multiple currencies.</p>
  <% if @connection.last_report_status %><p role="status"><%= @connection.last_report_status %>: <%= @connection.last_report_message %><% if @connection.last_reported_at %> Last completed <%= @connection.last_reported_at.utc.iso8601 %>.<% end %></p><% end %>
  <% if Current.user.can?('settings.write') && @connection.credentials_saved? %>
    <%= form_with url: import_reporting_pos_connection_path(@provider[:key]), method: :post, data: { turbo: false }, class: 'flex flex-wrap gap-3 items-end' do %>
      <div><%= label_tag :from, 'First UTC date (optional)' %><%= date_field_tag :from, nil, class: 'input' %></div>
      <div><%= label_tag :to, 'Last UTC date (optional)' %><%= date_field_tag :to, nil, class: 'input' %></div>
      <%= submit_tag 'Import reporting data', class: 'btn-primary' %>
    <% end %>
    <p class="text-xs text-taupe">Defaults to the previous 7 days. Each window must be at most 31 days. Imports run in the job queue; refresh to see completion or failure. Replays update existing source transactions. An unobserved void or decline that has left the unsettled list may be missing; compare portal exports for a complete historical audit.</p>
  <% end %>
  <%= form_with url: pos_connection_path(@provider[:key]), method: :get, data: { turbo: false }, class: 'flex flex-wrap gap-3 items-end' do %>
    <div><%= label_tag :report_date, 'Reporting day (UTC)' %><%= date_field_tag :report_date, @report_date, class: 'input' %></div><%= submit_tag 'View day', class: 'btn-ghost' %>
  <% end %>
  <p class="text-sm">Settled amounts for this UTC day, grouped by currency and latest status: <% (@report_totals || {}).each do |(currency, status), total| %><span><%= currency || 'Currency unknown' %> · <%= status %>: <%= total.to_s('F') %>; </span><% end %></p>
  <p class="text-sm">Current statuses of payments submitted this UTC day: <%= (@report_status_counts || {}).to_json %></p>
  <p class="text-xs text-taupe">Showing up to 100 of <%= @report_transaction_count || 0 %> transactions submitted or settled this UTC day, and up to 30 batches settled this day. Totals include all imported rows with a known currency for the settlement day; unknown currency amounts are excluded. Void execution timestamps are not provided; status counts use submission day. Amounts are source amounts, not net bank deposits. Refund amounts remain positive and are identified by type/status.</p>
  <div class="overflow-x-auto"><table class="min-w-full text-sm"><thead><tr><th>Source transaction / original</th><th>Submitted UTC</th><th>Type / status</th><th>Authorized / settled</th><th>Tip / customer surcharge</th><th>Batch / settlement</th></tr></thead><tbody>
    <% (@report_transactions || []).each do |row| %><tr>
      <td><%= row.source_transaction_id %><br><%= row.reference_transaction_id %></td>
      <td><%= row.submitted_at.utc.iso8601 %></td><td><%= row.transaction_type %><br><%= row.payment_status %></td>
      <td><%= row.currency || 'Currency unknown' %><br><%= row.authorized_amount.to_s('F') %> / <%= row.settled_amount.to_s('F') %></td>
      <td><%= row.tip_amount&.to_s('F') || 'Unknown' %> / <%= row.surcharge_amount&.to_s('F') || 'Unknown' %></td>
      <td><%= row.source_batch_id %><br><%= row.settlement_state %><br><%= row.settled_at&.utc&.iso8601 %></td>
    </tr><% end %>
  </tbody></table></div>
  <div class="overflow-x-auto"><table class="min-w-full text-sm"><thead><tr><th>Source batch</th><th>Settlement UTC / status</th><th>Payment method</th><th>Source statistics</th></tr></thead><tbody>
    <% (@report_batches || []).each do |row| %><tr><td><%= row.source_batch_id %></td><td><%= row.settled_at&.utc&.iso8601 %><br><%= row.settlement_state %></td><td><%= row.payment_method %></td><td><%= row.statistics.to_json %></td></tr><% end %>
  </tbody></table></div>
</section>
